{
  "schema": "chronolog-dataset/0",
  "dataset": "elder-scrolls",
  "title": "The Elder Scrolls, Merethic Era to the Fourth Era",
  "notes": [
    "NOT LOADED. This is the acceptance fixture for era support. Every coordinate here is an era coordinate, and no year on this calendar is a year on any other one.",
    "The era is a level, above year, and year numbering restarts inside each era. An era level value is its KEY (ME, 1E, 2E, 3E, 4E), not an integer; `coordinate.eras.entries` carries the ordinal that puts the keys in order.",
    "Merethic years DESCEND: ME 2500 is older than ME 1000, and ME 1 is the year immediately before 1E 1. `direction` says which way a given era's numbers run.",
    "An era's `years` is its length: 1E is 2920 years, 2E is 896, 3E is 433. Only an INTERIOR era needs a closed length, because that is the only thing anything has to count across. The first era in the table may be open below it and the last open above it, and both of these are.",
    "The months are Gregorian-length and there are twelve of them, so the `tamriel` calendar family's month and day arithmetic is the Gregorian family's. The era level above year is the whole of what is new.",
    "Morndas is aligned to the Gregorian Monday, which is a declared convention and not a lore claim: cycle `offset` is the cycle index of day zero.",
    "Where the lore gives only a year, the coordinate stops at year. Where it gives a date, the date is there. Merethic entries carry the `approximate` trait because Merethic year numbers are not attested.",
    "The Dawn Era has no entry. It precedes the Merethic and has no year axis at all, time there being the thing that had not started behaving yet. An era table of named, year-counted eras cannot hold it."
  ],
  "requires": [],
  "frames": [
    {
      "id": "frame:tamriel-calendar",
      "title": "Tamrielic calendar",
      "traits": ["line", "temporal", "calendar"],
      "coordinate": {
        "kind": "tamriel",
        "levels": [
          { "name": "era" },
          { "name": "year", "within": "era", "transition": "tamriel.yearsInEra" },
          {
            "name": "month",
            "within": "year",
            "transition": "tamriel.monthsInYear",
            "names": [
              "Morning Star", "Sun's Dawn", "First Seed", "Rain's Hand",
              "Second Seed", "Midyear", "Sun's Height", "Last Seed",
              "Hearthfire", "Frostfall", "Sun's Dusk", "Evening Star"
            ]
          },
          { "name": "day", "within": "month", "transition": "tamriel.daysInMonth" },
          { "name": "hour", "within": "day", "radix": "24" },
          { "name": "minute", "within": "hour", "radix": "60" },
          { "name": "second", "within": "minute", "radix": "60" }
        ],
        "cycles": [
          {
            "name": "weekday",
            "radix": "7",
            "offset": "3",
            "names": ["Morndas", "Tirdas", "Middas", "Turdas", "Fredas", "Loredas", "Sundas"]
          }
        ],
        "eras": {
          "level": "era",
          "entries": [
            { "key": "ME", "ordinal": "0", "name": "Merethic Era", "direction": "descending", "firstYear": "1", "years": "open" },
            { "key": "1E", "ordinal": "1", "name": "First Era", "direction": "ascending", "firstYear": "1", "years": "2920" },
            { "key": "2E", "ordinal": "2", "name": "Second Era", "direction": "ascending", "firstYear": "1", "years": "896" },
            { "key": "3E", "ordinal": "3", "name": "Third Era", "direction": "ascending", "firstYear": "1", "years": "433" },
            { "key": "4E", "ordinal": "4", "name": "Fourth Era", "direction": "ascending", "firstYear": "1", "years": "open" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
